  "5a061558-e184-b84d-bc49-767ec7d425a2"],
 "\[LineSeparator]shows a manipulate panel which allows to optimize the dixon \
echos using the condition number of the water fat model."
}], "Usage",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.003804553182785*^9},
